7D7AF][/dim]Replace the manual visual snapshot workflow with a reviewable, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]staged fix-tui-screenshots command that updates goldens during [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]local check-full and explicit agent calls, while CI checks the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]complete corpus without accepting it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]fix_tui_screenshots.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/fix_tui_screenshots.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-12z[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-12z/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Collect complete screenshot candidates without changing [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]goldens[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-protocol[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-protocol: add an isolated, versioned candidate-capture protocol [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the shared ACE and pager fixtures, with xdist-safe records, execution[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completeness evidence, and focused regression tests. Preserve existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendering, convergence checks, and direct comparison behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Compare candidates and safely apply screenshot changes[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]maintenance-runner[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture-protocol[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]maintenance-runner: implement tools/fix_tui_screenshots with explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check mode, governed pytest execution, exact pixel comparison, bounded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stability verification, conservative orphan handling, recoverable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]application, and tests for failures and unchanged golden trees.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make every generated screenshot change reviewable[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]change-reports[dim] · [dim][/dim]after maintenance-runner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]change-reports: extend the existing visual report pipeline to consume [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the run manifest and report created, updated, and stale screenshots, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preserving before images, grouped diffs, contact sheets, JSON, CI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]annotations, and durable per-run output on successful updates as well as[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failures.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Switch commands, exhaustive verification, CI, and agent [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]guidance[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]workflow-integration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after change-reports[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]workflow-integration: expose the canonical Just recipe, call its update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]form from local check-full and its explicit check form from the existing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CI visual job, migrate old entry points and documentation, update the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two relevant reference memories, and validate the combined workflow [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before landing.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-12z","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-12z.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4339f8822754756b0f69e07208a27c15","started_at":"2026-09-18T14:42:01.820535+00:00","state":"completed"},{"